      "text": "追逐照亮天空的金色流星，沿主线揭开金色传说，并用百余支线补全新世界",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "◆Chase the golden meteors and uncover the secrets of the golden legend, with abundant mainline chapters waiting for you to play! ◆ Explore a brand new world, experience different customs, and learn more about this world through more than a hundred side quests!",
